      "profile": "Explicit logical Session end; signed native live subscriptions; finite HTTP catch-up; actual asynchronous local vCon finalization",
      "assertions": [
        "Original reason_code/reason, known actor Participant/epoch and timestamp agree with the stored original Session outcome for two subscribed identities.",
