  "implementation": [
    "Fresh schema88 freezes a small immutable terminal fact at original journal insertion while the terminal record snapshot is still pending. Capture is independent of later record snapshot release.",
    "Current session_get and original/current Session source access remain required. Selected Session resource readers are included through actual native delivery.",
    "Canonical and generic terminal Session journal writers retain original Session view/reason/time and known ordinary actor attribution. Unspecified runtime numeric reasons use0 and missing text uses unspecified; no provider result is inferred.",
    "The pinned dispatcher admits session.ended only under its original Conversation/reply scope and deadline. The SDK validates Session-scoped terminal hints in finite batches.",
    "TypeScript/Python now use the current shared Session snapshot and session_control shapes instead of the obsolete initiator/counterpart snapshot. Both decode terminal metadata with exact Session/revision/time binding and bounded reason/actor fields.",
    "All33 positive shared event vectors now match generated schema88 OpenAPI; the earlier stale snapshot vector/schema mismatch is resolved."
  ],
